 </td>\n<td> 9  </td>\n<td> 17 </td>\n<td> 21 </td>\n<td> 44 </td>\n<td>−23</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">21</td>\n</tr><tr style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\"> <td>16</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%85tvidabergs_FF\" title=\"Åtvidabergs FF\">Åtvidabergs FF</a>  </td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td> 2  </td>\n<td> 9  </td>\n<td> 19 </td>\n<td> 25 </td>\n<td> 55 </td>\n<td>−30</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight:bold;\">15</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Nedflyttningskval\">Nedflyttningskval</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2015&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Nedflyttningskval\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fotbollsallsvenskan_2015&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Nedflyttningskval\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Falkenbergs_FF\" title=\"Falkenbergs FF\">Falkenbergs FF</a> spelade kvalspel mot det tredjeplacerade laget i <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2015\" title=\"Superettan 2015\">superettan 2015</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Sirius_FK\" title=\"IK Sirius FK\">IK Sirius</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Falkenbergs_FF\" title=\"Falkenbergs FF\">Falkenbergs FF</a> kvalificerade sig via kvalet till <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2016\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2016\">fotbollsallsvenskan 2016</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Sirius_FK\" title=\"IK Sirius FK\">IK Sirius</a> gick till <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2016\" title=\"Superettan 2016\">superettan 2016</a>.\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0px\" border=\"0\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px; width:100%; border-style:none; background-color:;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:3%; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.875em;\" id=\"1\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:right; font-weight:normal; font-size:0.9375em;\">5 november 2015</td>\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:right; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/IK_Sirius_FK\" title=\"IK Sirius FK\">IK Sirius</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:12%; text-align:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;\">\n2 – 2</td>\n\n<td style=\"width:24%; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; font-size:1em;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Falkenbergs_FF\" title=\"Falkenbergs FF\">Falkenbergs FF</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:21%; text-align:left; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Studenternas_IP\" title=\"Studenternas IP\">Studenternas IP</a></td>\n<th style=\"width:4%; font-size:0.9375em;\"></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.9375em;\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"3\">18:00&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Koordinerad_universell_tid\" title=\"Koordinerad universell tid\">UTC+1</a><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:right; font-size:0.875em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moses_Ogbu\" title=\"Moses Ogbu\">Ogbu</a> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A5l_(sport)\" title=\"Mål\"><img alt=\"Mål\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></a></span>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle;\">11&#8242;</span>,&#160;<span style=\"font-size:10px;vertical-align:middle;\">64&#8242;</span><br /></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:0.875em;\">(1 – 1)<br /><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://svenskfotboll.se/cuper-och-serier/information/?scr=result&amp;fmid=3189392\">Rapport</a></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:left; fon